# The demo workspace ships as versioned, human-readable source (manifest, sync-config,
# NDJSON transactions, ELSTER config). The SQLite ledger is a derived artifact — it is
# regenerated from the committed NDJSON on the first demo run, so it is NOT committed.
ledger.db*
